<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending December 28, 1996, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  12-28-96		257000	    252.7</p>
